### Feature HealthRecord — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico (is_active = false)
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

# @name deleteHealthRecordPhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/fichas-sanitarias/{{id}}

###

# @name deleteHealthRecordLogical
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/fichas-sanitarias/{{id}}/deactivate
